The tag queries in this directory are copied unchanged from the tree-sitter
grammars' own queries/tags.scm, at the grammar versions whose WebAssembly builds
@vscode/tree-sitter-wasm 0.3.1 ships:

  javascript.scm  tree-sitter-javascript 0.25.0  https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-javascript
  typescript.scm  tree-sitter-typescript 0.23.2  https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript
  python.scm      tree-sitter-python 0.25.0      https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-python
  go.scm          tree-sitter-go 0.25.0          https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-go
  rust.scm        tree-sitter-rust 0.24.0        https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-rust

